   261	§4.3, promoted). (ii) In the non-constant stratum `Pi` and all `Pi_i` are `3`-cycles
   262	(SK-5 + the `A_4` word equation, promoted). (iii) `rho_inf . T = T` forces
   263	`T_1 = sigma^{E} . T_1` (Theorem TUBE-2). (iv) `E = -7`, `3 nmid 7`, and the
