   265	exists for `Delta = (8,6,11)`, and the row is dead** — the same inference shape as the
   266	promoted THEOREM SK-4. The kill is independent of the partition of `delta_aff = 11`
   267	into `k_p`'s, hence independent of nodality, and independent of the realization
   268	question.
