+```text
+family-3 g=2 cabling and rho_inf = C_2(delta_4^3).iota,
+e(iota) = 2*delta_aff - 29 = 14 - beta_1,
+constant-stratum death,
+SK-5 plus the A_4 word equation for non-constant block products,
+TUBE-2 fixedness,
+B_2 stabilizer = 3Z.
