+```text
+(d,n) = (8,6), g=2, one place at P_inf,
+beta_1 = 32 - c, delta_aff = 21 - (beta_1-1)/2,
+(Dbar . L_infty)_{P_inf} = 8, germ A_{beta_1-1}.
