+```text
+D = -27*alpha_0^2*alpha_3^2
+    +18*alpha_0*alpha_1*alpha_2*alpha_3
+    -4*alpha_0*alpha_2^3
+    -4*alpha_1^3*alpha_3
+    +alpha_1^2*alpha_2^2
