+The parity statement is not an extra geometric assumption. The local type is a
+unibranch multiplicity-2 `A_{beta_1-1}` germ, so `gcd(2,beta_1)=1` and
+`beta_1` is odd. Since `8` is even, `3*kappa = beta_1 - 8` is odd, and
+`kappa` is odd.
